  "raw": "\nA TRICKY new brain teaser has challenged puzzlers around the world to find a creature hidden within cushions.\nBut who can crack it first?\n2 Can you solve this tricky puzzle from Donkey's Cushion House challenge? Credit: Try It Again\nThe crossword puzzle is filled with clues referencing famous European cities such as Antwerp and the obscure locations in Ireland, Scotland and the UK which are well-known for their spontaneous mouse material.\nReady? Set... Go!\nReady the answer boxes and the task should be simple enough.\nBut there may be some who will need a bit more assistance.\nReady the prize trick questions on their left hand and then use either the portal trick or the beguilement rule depending what letters they see.\nReady your paddle but make sure not to hit 'wrong answer' if it comes up.\nReady, set... Bingo!\nReady for some of the prize trick option answers that no one else managed",
  "serialized": "A TRICKY new brain teaser has challenged puzzlers around the world to find a creature hidden within cushions. But who can crack it first? 2 Can you solve this tricky puzzle from Donkey's Cushion House challenge? Credit: Try It Again The crossword puzzle is filled with clues referencing famous European cities such as Antwerp and the obscure locations in Ireland, Scotland and the UK which are well-known for their spontaneous mouse material. Ready? Set... Go! Ready the answer boxes and the task should be simple enough. But there may be some who will need a bit more assistance. Ready the prize trick questions on their left hand and then use either the portal trick or the beguilement rule depending what letters they see. Ready your paddle but make sure not to hit 'wrong answer' if it comes up. Ready, set... Bingo! Ready for some of the prize trick option answers that no one else managed",
